\n在每次迭代中，都需要检查数字是否为**0**。如果是**0**，需要删除该项（**0**）并将其追加到列表末尾。\n\n循坏结束后，就可以打印列表了。","text_html":"<p>一个列表可以有多个 <strong>0</strong>。因此，我们需要循环查看列表中的每个数字。</p>\n<p>在每次迭代中，都需要检查数字是否为<strong>0</strong>。如果是<strong>0</strong>，需要删除该项（<strong>0</strong>）并将其追加到列表末尾。</p>\n<p>循坏结束后，就可以打印列表了。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}]}},{"type":"ChallengeRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f34cc7f6-3311-3aea-97a0-2604c38924f1","title":"将零移至列表末尾","challenge_id":793,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"challenge_id":793,"title":"将零移至列表末尾","difficulty":"Easy","points":10,"success_ratio":"68.3%","problem_statement_md":"编写一个Python程序，将列表中所有等于零（**0**）的元素移至列表的末尾。","problem_statement_en_md":"## Problem Description\n\nCreate a Python program to move all the zero (**0**) elements of a list to the end of the list.\n\n### Example\n\n**input**\n```text\nfor a list [1, 0, 2, 0, 4, 0, 6, 5]\n```\n\n**output**\n```text\n[1, 2, 4, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0]\n```","input_format_md":"","output_format_md":"","constraints_md":"","hint_md":"","code_templates":[{"id":2033,"language":"python3","template":"# 用你的代码替换 ___\n\n# 定义一个数字列表\nlst = eval(input())\n\n# 遍历列表中的每个数字\nfor ___:\n\n    # 如果数字是0\n    if ___:\n\n        # 从列表中移除该数字\n        ___\n\n        # 同时将该数字添加到列表的末尾\n        ___\n\n# 打印列表\nprint(lst)","template_head":"","template_tail":"","solution_code":"# 定义一个数字列表\nlst = eval(input())\n\n# 遍历列表中的每个数字\nfor item in lst:\n\n    # 如果数字是0\n    if item == 0:\n\n        # 从列表中移除该数字\n        lst.remove(item)\n\n        # 同时将该数字添加到列表的末尾\n        lst.append(item)\n\n# 打印列表\nprint(lst)","prepend_code":"","append_code":"","file_name":"","judge_mode":"testcase","unittest_codes":[],"additional_files":[]}],"testcases":[{"id":2182,"case_no":1,"stdin":"[1, 0, 2, 0, 4, 0, 6, 5]","expected_output":"[1, 2, 4, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0]\n","explanation":"","sample":true,"additional":false}],"user_data":null}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"027","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/027/page/1466"}
